OL,3,GNEWSAExtra patrols to tackle rise in
OL,4,Afires in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra police patrols will be brought in
OL,7,Fafter a rise in fires started by young
OL,8,Fpeople in a park in South Wigston.
OL,10,FOadby and Wigston Police said it had
OL,11,Freceived reports of 11 fires being
OL,12,Fstarted in the last three months at
OL,13,FBlaby Road Park - with six in the last
OL,14,Fmonth alone.
OL,16,FThe policing team said it was
OL,17,Finvestigating the fires and asked
OL,18,Fparents to be aware of what items
OL,19,Fchildren were taking out with them.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
